{"kode":"MTMH","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"1000003629","email":["corporate-secretary@rsmurniteguh.com"],"fax":"(+62) 61 8050 1800","npwp":"03.096.087.6-113.000","phone":"(+62) 61 8050 1888","website":"www.rsmurniteguh.com","key":"","lastupdate":"2022-04-20T10:27:37+07:00","value":"<td colspan='4'>Jl. Jawa No, 2, LK II, Gg. Buntu, Medan Timur, Kota Medan\nSumatera Utara – 20231\n\n        \t\t  \t\t\tPhone: (+62) 61 8050 1888\n        \t\t  \t\t\tFax: (+62) 61 8050 1800\n                            NPWP: 03.096.087.6-113.000\n        \t\t  \t\t\tEmail: corporate-secretary@rsmurniteguh.com\n        \t\t  \t\t\tWebsite: www.rsmurniteguh.com\n\n        \t  \t\t\t</td>","office":"Jl. Jawa No, 2, LK II, Gg. Buntu, Medan Timur, Kota Medan Sumatera Utara – 20231"}],"background":"PT Murni Sadar Tbk. (MTMH) merupakan perusahaan yang bergerak di bidang pelayanan jasa kesehatan dan membawahi beberapa rumah sakit swasta yang ada di Medan, Jakarta, Tangerang, Bali, dengan total kapasitas tempat tidur sebanyak 858 buah. Murni Teguh Hospitals Group memiliki rencana pengembangan rumah sakit secara bertahap ke daerah-daerah lain di Indonesia sehingga dapat dijangkau oleh seluruh lapisan masyarakat. Kami juga menerapkan tata kelola perusahaan yang baik (Good Corporate Governance/GCG) yang bertujuan untuk memberikan acuan yang sama bagi stakeholder rumah sakit yang dimiliki Murni Teguh Hospitals Group, demikian pula ada standar mutu yang sama di seluruh rumah sakit sehingga masyarakat dapat mempercayakan pelayanan kesehatannya kepada kami sebagai grup rumah sakit yang handal. Motto kami yaitu Make Tommorow More Healthy mempunyai arti upaya kesehatan yang dilakukan oleh Murni Teguh Hospitals bersifat komprehensif dan paripurna agar masyarakat dapat hidup lebih sehat di masa mendatang.\n\nPada saat ini, MTMH memiliki 5 rumah sakit di Medan, Jakarta, Bali dan Tangerang dan mengoperasikan 1 rumah sakit di Medan dengan menggunakan metode kerja sama operasional, yaitu: Rumah Sakit Murni Teguh Memorial Hospital, Rumah Sakit Aminah, Rumah Sakit Murni Teguh Sudirman, Rumah Sakit Ibu dan Anak Rosiva, Rumah Sakit Murni Teguh Bali, dan\nRumah Sakit Murni Teguh Methodist Susanna Wesley.","history":{"amount":"325 B","board":"Papan Utama","date":"20 Apr 2022","price":"1280","registrar":"","shares":"254,022,800","underwriters":["Ciptadana Sekuritas Asia","BCA Sekuritas"],"administrative_bureau":"PT Adimitra Jasa Korpora","free_float":"11.81%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[],"director":[{"id":"13838233","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:39:42+07:00","value":"dr. Jong Khai, MARS"},{"id":"13838234","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:39:42+07:00","value":"Clement Zichri Ang, M.Sc"},{"id":"13838235","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:39:42+07:00","value":"Felix Vincent Ang, B.Eng"},{"id":"13838236","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:39:42+07:00","value":"dr. Sharon Hanmy Angel MRes, MPM, MARS"}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"13838238","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:39:42+07:00","value":"dr. Andi Wahyuningsih Attas, Sp. An., KIC, MARS"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"13838237","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:39:42+07:00","value":"Tjin Ten Chun"}],"president_director":[{"id":"13838232","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2025-07-09T09:39:42+07:00","value":"DR.dr. Mutiara, MHA, MKT"}],"vice_president":[],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[{"id":"12539184","key":"","lastupdate":"2022-04-20T10:27:37+07:00","value":"{\"name\":\"Anton Sudjarot\",\"phone\":\"(+62) 61 8050 188\",\"email\":\"corporate-secretary@rsmurniteguh.com\"}"}],"shareholder":[{"percentage":"32.56%","name":"PT SUMATERA TEKNINDO","value":"673.46 M","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","v